1
00:00:00,226 --> 00:00:02,976
(Sheldon:)...Holy Roller Bowling League
Championship team.

2
00:00:04,314 --> 00:00:06,524
Seven-to-12-year-old division.

3
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:08,730
(Sheldon:)Also, Penny's pretty good.

4
00:00:09,777 --> 00:00:11,197
[CLICKS TONGUE]

5
00:00:11,696 --> 00:00:14,576
(Wil:)Great. Then it's on.

6
00:00:15,617 --> 00:00:17,947
(Sheldon:)Foolish Wil Wheaton.

7
00:00:18,119 --> 00:00:20,459
(Sheldon:)It was never off.

8
00:00:23,208 --> 00:00:24,458
(Wil:)Yes!

9
00:00:24,667 --> 00:00:26,417
(Sheldon:)A common spare.

10
00:00:26,586 --> 00:00:30,046
(Sheldon:)The Miss Congeniality
of the bowling pageant.

11
00:00:30,423 --> 00:00:33,553
(Sheldon:)Before you jump on Twitter
to tout your modest accomplishment...

12
00:00:33,760 --> 00:00:36,050
(Sheldon:)...watch how it's really done.

13
00:00:36,262 --> 00:00:38,642
(Sheldon:)I am the ball.

14
00:00:40,099 --> 00:00:42,229
(Sheldon:)My thoughts are its thoughts.

15
00:00:42,393 --> 00:00:44,773
(Sheldon:)Its holes are my holes.

16
00:00:53,821 --> 00:00:55,531
(Sheldon:)Yes.

17
00:00:55,740 --> 00:00:59,020
(Sheldon:)Tweet that, Tweety Bird.

